    {
      "text": "<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>  is uniform and both its magnitude and direction depend on  <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>",
      "is_correct": true
